  m_text: "<b>Wilson</b>\nLow Poly Chicken \u2014 Pjager (CC BY 4.0)\nYumurta \u2014
    Casca_Servillius (CC BY 4.0)\n\n<b>Ev ve e\u015Fyalar</b>\nMedieval Room Kit
    \u2014 1Luka2\nDOLLHOUSE Modular Low Poly Interiors \u2014 ForgeWorks\nStylized
    Tavern Prop Pack \u2014 VEE-TREX\nLowPolyInteriorsFree, 3Digitalis Interior Props,
    StylArts, FarmHouse, Modular Sewer Props (Ata Khani), Roadside Tales Fences (EmaceArt)
    \u2014 Unity Asset Store Standart EULA\nKayKit Adventurers \u2014 Kay Lousberg
    (CC0)\n\n<b>Yaz\u0131 tipi</b>\nLiberation Sans (SIL Open Font License)\n\n<b>Men\xFC
    aray\xFCz\xFC</b>\nAh\u015Fap/par\u015F\xF6men g\xF6rselleri, ikonlar ve aray\xFCz
    sesleri proje i\xE7inde kodla \xFCretildi.\n\nAyr\u0131nt\u0131l\u0131 liste:
    README \u203A At\u0131flar\n\nOyunumuzu deneyen herkese te\u015Fekk\xFCrler!"
